Its CoreSimulator + SimulatorKit runtime bridge and IOSurface framebuffer logic
are derived from baguette's CoreSimulators.swift and SimulatorKitScreen.swift,
also licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Bob modifications: reduced the API to a project-scoped native tab; checked runtime
selectors and message size; delivered framebuffer callbacks on the main queue;
rendered IOSurfaces in a native layer; added focus-scoped user input and lifecycle
cleanup. No SimKit or baguette package is required at runtime.
